      "description": "Piyush Gaikwad Posted on Dec 20, <b>2025</b> <b>Branch</b> <b>Protection</b> <b>Rules</b> <b>vs</b> <b>Rulesets</b>: The Right Way to Protect Your Git Repository # git # programming # devops # productivity Do you need a lot of manual clicking every time a new <b>branch</b> is created or a repository <b>rule</b> needs to be enforced 🧐?",
      "source": "dev.to",
      "engine": "duckduckgo"
    },
    {
      "title": "GitHub Rulesets vs. Branch Protection: Practical Differences and ...",
